msgid "Update"
msgstr ""

msgid "Today, we released Quarkus 3.23."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"3.23 comes with a lot of small improvements and some bugfixes together with "
"a couple of new features:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/47631[#47631] - Enable named data "
"sources for Hibernate Reactive"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/47445[#47445] - OIDC: Add bearer "
"token step up authentication"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To update to Quarkus 3.23, we recommend updating to the latest version of "
"the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Note that `quarkus update` can update your applications from any version of "
"Quarkus (including 2.x) to Quarkus 3.23."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For more information about the adjustments you need to make to your "
"applications, please refer to the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/"
"Migration-Guide-3.23[Quarkus 3.23 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Named data sources for Hibernate Reactive"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"With 3.22, we started the journey of bringing the Hibernate Reactive "
"extension up to par with the Hibernate ORM one."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In 3.23, it's now possible to point Hibernate Reactive to a named datasource."
""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The next step will be to have support for multiple named persistence units "
"for Hibernate Reactive and hopefully it will arrive in 3.24."
msgstr ""

msgid "OIDC bearer step up authentication"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Quarkus 3.23 introduces support for the OAuth 2.0 Step Up Authentication "
"Challenge Protocol."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can learn more about it in the https://quarkus.io/guides/security-oidc-"
"bearer-token-authentication#step-up-authentication[dedicated section] of the "
"OIDC Bearer token authentication guide."
msgstr ""

msgid "Platform component upgrades"
msgstr ""

msgid "Quarkus CXF"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Quarkus CXF 3.23 was released and is now available in https://code.quarkus."
"io/?extension-search=origin:platform%20quarkus-cxf[Quarkus Platform 3.23].\n"
"Check the https://docs.quarkiverse.io/quarkus-cxf/dev/release-notes/3.23.0."
"html[Quarkus CXF 3.23.0] and https://docs.quarkiverse.io/quarkus-cxf/dev/"
"release-notes/3.23.1.html[3.23.1] release notes for more information about "
"what is new in these releases."
msgstr ""

msgid "Camel Quarkus"
msgstr ""

msgid "Camel Quarkus has been upgraded to 3.23.0."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get the full changelog of https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/3.23.0.CR1[3.23.0.CR1] and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/3.23.0[3.23.0] on GitHub."
msgstr ""

msgid "Contributors"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Quarkus community is growing and has now https://github.com/quarkusio/"
"quarkus/graphs/contributors[1083 contributors].\n"
"Many many thanks to each and everyone of them."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In particular for the 3.23 release, thanks to Aditya Thakur, Alexandre "
"Dutra, Alexey Loubyansky, Andrii Denysenko, Andy Damevin, appiepollo14, "
"ayagmar, Bruno Baptista, Clement Escoffier, Fedor Dudinsky, Foivos Zakkak, "
